Tempo Warp audio
================

All gameplay music is synthesized at runtime with Tone.js (drums, bass, lead, pad).
No third-party sample packs are bundled.

Tracks (random on load, or ?track=):
  neon   — four-on-the-floor drive (~128 BPM)
  drift  — half-time glide (~92 BPM)
  surge  — fast break energy (~142 BPM)
  pulse  — mid-tempo hypnotic techno (~110 BPM)
  veil   — soft float, sparse air (~78 BPM)
  razor  — sharp industrial syncopation (~155 BPM)

Debug (?debug=1): click the track button to cycle.
